{"route":"/docs/components/label","text":"Skip to content SevenUI DocsPrimitivesComponentsBlocksPro Search⌘K Sign in Docs Primitives Components Blocks Pro Introduction Installation Theming Primitives Accordion Alert Alert Dialog Aspect Ratio Attachment Avatar Badge Breadcrumb Bubble Button Button Group Calendar Card Carousel Chart Checkbox Collapsible Combobox Command Context Menu Dialog Direction Drawer Dropdown Menu Empty Field Form Hover Card Input Input Group Input OTP Item Kbd Label Marker Menubar Message Message Scroller Meter Native Select Navigation Menu Number Field Pagination Popover Progress Questionnaire Radio Group Resizable Scroll Area Select Separator Sheet Sidebar Skeleton Slider Spinner Switch Table Tabs Textarea Toast Toggle Toggle Group Toolbar Tooltip Docs /Primitives /Label On this page Installation Usage API reference Label Label Displays a label for form inputs. PreviewCode Email TSX import { Input } from \"@/registry/base/ui/input\"; import { Label } from \"@/registry/base/ui/label\"; export default function LabelDemo() { return ( <div className=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"> <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label> <Input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" /> </div> ); } Installation Bash Package manager:npmpnpmyarnbun npx shadcn@latest add @sevenui/labelpnpm dlx shadcn@latest add @sevenui/labelyarn dlx shadcn@latest add @sevenui/labelbunx --bun shadcn@latest add @sevenui/label Usage TSX import { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"; import { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"; <div> <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label> <Input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" /> </div>; API reference Label Extends the native <label> element. It dims automatically when its control is disabled — both as a sibling after the control (peer-disabled) and with the control nested inside (has-[:disabled]). Prefer the sibling pattern with htmlFor. Base UI ships no Label primitive; inside a Field, use FieldLabel for automatic wiring instead. Prop Type Default htmlFor string — or nest the control inside instead — Was this page helpful? Yes No Thanks for your feedback! PreviousKbdNextMarker On this page Installation Usage API reference Label Edit on GitHub Scroll to top Copy as Markdown Open in chat Open in v0 Open in ChatGPT Open in Claude Open in T3 Chat Open in Scira Open in Cursor SevenUI Base UI powered primitives, distributed through the shadcn registry. PrimitivesButtonInputSelectComboboxCheckboxSwitchSliderTableAll primitives → ResourcesDocumentationInstallationThemingGitHub Built onBase UIshadcn registryTailwind CSS MIT License © 2026 SevenUI TermsPrivacy","headings":[{"depth":1,"text":"Label","id":null},{"depth":2,"text":"Installation","id":"installation"},{"depth":2,"text":"Usage","id":"usage"},{"depth":2,"text":"API reference","id":"api-reference"},{"depth":3,"text":"Label","id":"label"}],"links":["#content","/","/docs","/docs/components/accordion","/components","/blocks","/pro","https://github.com/useui/sevenui","/account","/docs","/docs/components/accordion","/components","/blocks","/pro","/docs","/docs/installation","/docs/theming","/docs/components","/docs/components/accordion","/docs/components/alert","/docs/components/alert-dialog","/docs/components/aspect-ratio","/docs/components/attachment","/docs/components/avatar","/docs/components/badge","/docs/components/breadcrumb","/docs/components/bubble","/docs/components/button","/docs/components/button-group","/docs/components/calendar","/docs/components/card","/docs/components/carousel","/docs/components/chart","/docs/components/checkbox","/docs/components/collapsible","/docs/components/combobox","/docs/components/command","/docs/components/context-menu","/docs/components/dialog","/docs/components/direction","/docs/components/drawer","/docs/components/dropdown-menu","/docs/components/empty","/docs/components/field","/docs/components/form","/docs/components/hover-card","/docs/components/input","/docs/components/input-group","/docs/components/input-